      "subject": "fix(auth): fire signup credit grant on session restore",
      "body": "Users who update without logging out were missing welcome and daily\ncredits because grant_signup_credits only fired from the login and\nregister handlers. Adding it to get_session ensures credits are\ngranted on the next app open regardless of how the session was\nrestored. The call is idempotent (z-billing checks signup_grant_at)\nand fire-and-forget so it cannot slow the response.",
